[00:16.80]A multitude is gathering
[00:20.50]from ev’ry tribe and nation,
[00:24.70]Collected by the Christ and his
[00:30.68]anointed congregation.
[00:33.84]God’s Kingdom has been brought to birth;
[00:38.06]We pray his will be done on earth.
[00:42.40]This hope is a gift of priceless worth,
[00:46.64]Giving joy and consolation.
[00:51.35](Chorus)
[00:51.50]Praise our God, Jehovah; Praise his Son forever—
[00:55.76]King of all kings and the Lord of lords.
[00:59.80]Now unitedly we bow to his rule
[01:03.78]And praise him with one accord.
[01:08.84]We praise the Christ, our reigning King,
[01:18.90]with sounds of jubilation.
[01:22.81]This Prince of Peace will be our Judge
[01:27.39]and bring about salvation.
[01:31.60]We see the joys that lie ahead:
[01:35.90]An earth released from fear and dread;
[01:40.22]The time for our Lord to raise the dead.
[01:44.50]What a time for exultation!
[01:48.06](Chorus)
[01:48.21]Praise our God, Jehovah; Praise his Son forever—
[01:53.60]King of all kings and the Lord of lords.
[01:57.61]Now unitedly we bow to his rule
[02:01.66]And praise him with one accord.
